{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116059","id":3260283551,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7CU_qf","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116059","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116059.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116059.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116059","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116059/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116059/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116059/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6a8777930cc905edafde114354d8ca1aa81124bd","number":116059,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix repeated macOS file permission prompts regression in 4.6.1 (fixes #116054)","user":{"login":"jayvenn21","id":53269831,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMjY5ODMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53269831?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21","html_url":"https://github.com/jayvenn21","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvenn21/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"### Description\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes a regression introduced in Godot 4.6.1.rc1 on macOS where the editor repeatedly prompts for file access permissions, even after access has already been granted.\r\n\r\nThe issue:\r\n- Does not occur in Godot 4.6 stable\r\n- Occurs in 4.6.1.rc1\r\n- Reproduces consistently on macOS\r\n- Is especially noticeable when projects are stored on external volumes\r\n- Results in an infinite permission request loop, making the editor unusable\r\n\r\n### Cause\r\n\r\nThe regression appears to be related to incorrect handling of macOS security-scoped bookmarks, causing Godot to re-request file access instead of reusing an already granted permission.\r\n\r\n### Fix\r\n\r\nThis PR ensures that security-scoped resources are accessed in a balanced and persistent manner:\r\n- Prevents repeated permission requests once access has been granted\r\n- Restores correct reuse of file access permissions\r\n- Avoids re-triggering macOS permission dialogs during normal project operations\r\n\r\n### Reproduction\r\n\r\n1. Use Godot 4.6.1.rc1 on macOS\r\n2. Store a project on an external SSD\r\n3. Open and run the project\r\n4. Observe repeated permission popups\r\n\r\n### Result\r\n\r\nThe permission dialog appears once as expected and does not reappear during subsequent file access.\r\n\r\n### Related issue\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6051509301,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaLK0NQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/spam","name":"spam","description":"","color":"E94A26","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-02-08T19:26:05Z","updated_at":"2026-02-09T11:21:39Z","closed_at":"2026-02-08T20:25:45Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"6a8ce6b101a87e393b90470a4d181ab735